# Browser verification — ego-browser (preferred) or Aside

Worker ships user-visible product → verifies in a real browser **after its
own work**: locally first when not yet verified locally, then the same flow
on dev after the dev deploy.

- Tool: **`ego-browser` TaskSpace (preferred)** or **`aside repl`**.
  Forbidden: bare Playwright, Cursor `browser_*` MCP, other harnesses.
  `aside exec` is task delegation, not deterministic verification.
- **ego-browser:** skill `~/.agents/skills/ego-browser` (also under
  `~/.cursor/skills`, `~/.claude/skills`, `~/.codex/skills`). Run
  `ego-browser nodejs <<'EOF' … EOF`. One `taskSpace("<job>")` per job,
  print `spaceId`, resume with `taskSpace(<id>)`. Work in the space’s own
  tab (`p1`); never adopt/drive Chase’s live tab. `page.snapshot()` →
  act (`@ref` / `loc=css:` / CSS) → fresh snapshot → `page.screenshot({ path })`.
  `task.finish({ keep: [] })` when done. Do not import Chrome cookies.
- **aside repl:** Chase’s window is OK. `openTab(url)` in the current
  window. Never `chrome.windows.create`. No `page.context().newPage()` /
  `page.close()`. Do **not** type into Chase’s existing tab; open your own.
  Optional title `[Agent] <job>`. `snapshot(page, { interactive: true })`
  after each action; `console.log()` to return values. Close only tabs you
  opened.
- Dev (`www.dev.sume.com`) / prod (`www.sume.com`): **sumelabs workspace
  only**. Not sumelabs → STOP. Never customer workspaces (e.g. mobidoo).
- **Evidence hard lock (2026-09-11, #7110):** after any dest/prod browser
  verify, post **one** `gh issue comment` on the Job issue with **2–4
  screenshots** + host, `sumelabs`, **Auto**, SHA, pass/fail. Final report
  must include `SHOTS: <comment URL>`. No URL ⇒ no `DEST: pass`. Do not
  exit after main land while the dest deploy is still building. Recipe:
  `~/.agents/skills/sume-main-agent-orchestration/references/dest-verify-issue-shots.md`
- Do not confuse Aside CLI account (`aside account list`) with the Sume
  workspace or browser profile.

Policy SoT: `~/.agents/skills/sume-main-agent-orchestration/SKILL.md`
§ "Browser verification" + "Dest issue screenshots — HARD LOCK".
